This repository contains Model Derivatives of MiniMax H3, format conversions
of two upstream releases that are themselves Model Derivatives of MiniMax H3:

  * the Parallel Decoding Distillation acceleration LoRAs published by
    alibaba-pai, https://huggingface.co/alibaba-pai/MiniMax-H3-Acc-LoRAs
  * the FlashGen 4-step LoRA published by Beidouqixing under Apache-2.0,
    https://huggingface.co/Beidouqixing/minimax-h3-4step-lora-flashgen

MODIFICATION NOTICE
-------------------
Every .safetensors file in this repository has been modified from its
upstream form, by format transforms and a change of time basis, described in
README.md under "Files". Nothing was trained.
